<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114364" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χολ-ώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χολοειδής</span>
			, <i>like bile</i> or <i>gall, bilious,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκκρίσιες, ἔμες μα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				2.15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Epid.</u>
				6.4.4
			</span></i>.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χυμοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					86e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑγρότης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					506b3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χλωραὶ γλῶσσαι χολώδεες</span>”
				<i>caused by biliousness,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					6.5.8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χολώδεις</span>”
				<i>bilious persons,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Metaph.</u>
					981a12
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				7.26.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				15.568
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>bile-coloured,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρώματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					71b
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				83b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἷς ἂν ἐπὶ τὸ χολωδέστερον ἡ χρόα
					μεταβάλῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					17(2).270
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>bilious, angry,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. τι ὑποβλέπειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Vit. Auct.</u>
					7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>Im.</u>
				2.12
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
